{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bug Off</strong>\u00a0is a fun bug-squashing challenge where you get to control a pair of slippers to chase and squash funny bugs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Action:</strong> Control each slipper individually. Move, stomp, jump, chase and squash!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bugs Emojis:</strong>\u00a0They tease you when they feel safe and panic when they see another one get squashed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards:</strong> Earn points for squashing bugs and compete with other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements:</strong> Unlock achievements as proof of your squashing skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller Support:</strong> Fully compatible with Steam Input for a smooth controller experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Deck Support:</strong> Optimized UI and gameplay for a great experience on the Steam Deck.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"1K Bugs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667660/8eca69b990ee0d3f1b84102db5a6c8e94052dd19.jpg"},{"name":"10K Bugs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667660/8cbd9f2b0d8c67cf86d969ebf139e290b5c93d58.jpg"},{"name":"100K Bugs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667660/3717bff8da50c6deaf5028f821dba5b648999484.jpg"},{"name":"1000K Bugs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667660/ea9fcfe0502b8c15f14446ea31b1a6bce7493680.jpg"},{"name":"Multi-squash x2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667660/9ffbe696c11da6134999ccbb0a9e71612dcdd61f.jpg"},{"name":"Multi-squash x3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/a